      "content": "To help reduce the heat and soothe the burn, you can apply a cool compress or run it under cold tap water for a few minutes. Do not apply butter or a thick layer of Vaseline, as this can actually create a barrier that prevents the skin from \"breathing\" and potentially leading to infection or further irritation. Apply a thin layer of aloe vera or hydrocortisone cream if available, but avoid using ice directly on the skin to prevent further damage. If the blisters persist or worsen, seek medical attention.",
