      "content": "idk i feel like im just being extra. the pain is actually kinda dulling down now and the blisters aren't even that big. if i just put a really thick layer of butter on it, it would act like a natural bandage and keep the air away from the raw parts, right? i really dont want to deal with the hospital/doctor visit if i can just fix it here at home with what i have in the kitchen. wouldn't the fat in the butter help protect the skin?",
